{"id":"n84244-1-12","stage":5,"title":"표출 · 流露","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84244-1-12-1","ko":"사람들이 내가 자꾸 화난 사람 같아서 무섭대.","zh":"大家说我总像在生气，让人害怕。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"화난","meaning":"生气，发火","explanation":"화나다：生气，发火；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"화나다","audio":"/audio/380dff375fc26c29cffe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87582","senseId":"1","lemma":"화나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화난","audio":"/audio/02584872c61fa3f2a21a.mp3"}},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}},{"text":"같아서","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아서","audio":"/audio/a38b450f1fcf31c027d2.mp3"}},{"text":"무섭대.","meaning":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","explanation":"무섭다：可怕，恐怖，畏惧；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"2","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무섭대","audio":"/audio/e682a153e267ffac99d5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"380dff375fc26c29","term":"화나다","zh":"生气，发火","audio":"/audio/380dff375fc26c29cffe.mp3","entryId":"87582","definition":"非常懊恼或不合心意而心情变差。","pronunciation":["화ː나다"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"难以面对或想逃避某个人或某种状况。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ae44dfd8829157f981f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84244-1-12-2","ko":"네가 감정 표출에 너무 소극적이라서 그런가 봐.","zh":"可能是你太不愿意把感情表现出来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"감정","meaning":"感情","explanation":"감정：感情。","readings":[{"term":"감정","audio":"/audio/dbe241c452bb1c1503f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17312","senseId":"1","lemma":"감정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감정","audio":"/audio/dbe241c452bb1c1503f7.mp3"}},{"text":"표출에","meaning":"流露，显露","explanation":"표출：流露，显露；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"표출","audio":"/audio/a3f4cc8cf07cbc92a0c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84244","senseId":"1","lemma":"표출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"표출에","audio":"/audio/88f6a8636e646582da88.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"소극적이라서","meaning":"消极的，不主动的","explanation":"소극적：消极的，不主动的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"소극적","audio":"/audio/3a1859e24174f6d670f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49233","senseId":"1","lemma":"소극적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소극적이라서","audio":"/audio/001c08191b5945f5074c.mp3"}},{"text":"그런가","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런가","audio":"/audio/1871cee48506a0d12f8c.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","ent